Comment: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{=6}--------ED--------
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:55.68,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}念入りに書き込んだスケジュールも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:02.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今日は気分じゃなくて投げ出しました
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:06.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}大事な約束じゃなきゃたまには
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:12.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}行き当たりぱったりも　私っぽいや
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:17.48,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}相も変わらず毎日は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:20.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}慌ただしく続いて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:23.57,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}あれもこれも　予測できない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.57,0:22:27.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}こといっぱいで　退屈しないね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:31.06,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}さぁ　いっせーのせ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:34.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今日はどれにしようかな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:38.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}私が選ぶ思いのまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:41.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}迷ったりして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:47.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}踏み出していくんだ　Brand-new way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.25,0:22:52.76,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}震えたのはなんだった?　なんだろうね?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.15,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}確かめにいこう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:56.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Slowly step, glory days
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:59.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}So I'm fine today and tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:02.24,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Let's go out for the weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Eeny meeny miny moe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:55.68,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}就算多嗎精心填好的日程表
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:02.11,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}都隨心情左右被拋向六點鐘方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:06.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}若非什麼至關重要的約定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:12.42,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}偶爾心血來潮 也是我模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:17.48,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}日子依舊日復一日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:20.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}匆匆忙忙停不下腳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:23.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}看看這 瞧瞧那 全都出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.57,0:22:27.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}多彩的意外 根本不會感到無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:31.06,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}來呀 一二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:34.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今天該選什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:38.11,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}任性的指尖打著旋兒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:41.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}走呀 迷路彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:47.08,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}索性踏上嶄新的大道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.25,0:22:52.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}悸動的是心跳？還是預兆？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.15,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}去親眼確認就好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:56.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}慢步走 美好時光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:59.25,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今明往後 我亦無憂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:02.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}去漫遊 就在週末
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{=7}{\fad(200,200)\blur8}點指兵兵 人皆歡心

